<title>USA: CBOT overnight Project A ag volume 326 contracts.</title>
<headline>CBOT overnight Project A ag volume 326 contracts.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1996-12-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Chicago Board of Trade said its Project A overnight agricultural volume totaled 326 contracts versus 1,150 overnight Monday.</p>
<p>There were 68 wheat, 90 corn, 115 soybean, 48 soymeal and five oat contracts traded.</p>
<p>In overnight trading, wheat was 1-1/2 to 3-3/4 cents per bushel higher, corn was steady to 1/4 lower and soybeans were three to 4-1/4 cents per bushel higher.</p>
<p>((Chicago Newsdesk 312-408-8720))</p>
